"type": "pdf"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " Conducting an interview!", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: Proceeding with our interview, I have a few more questions I would like to ask you.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Absolutely.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: What is your greatest strength?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: My writing skills. Having interned as a copy editor for the last two years, I have strong attention to detail when it comes to writing. I have also written for several publications, so I'm able to shape my writing style to suit my task and audience.<br />", "id": 1, "time": "2000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: What is your greatest weakness?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Organization has never been my strongest point. But I implemented a time management system that really helped my organizational skills.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: And how do you handle stress?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: That's a good question. I actually work better under pressure and have found I enjoy working in a challenging environment. As a social media writer and editor, I thrived under quick deadlines and multiple projects.<br />", "id": 2, "time": "31000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: Great. I only have two more questions for you. Why do you think you are the right person for this job?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: I want this job because it seems tailored to my competencies, which include writing and editing. I understand that this company is on the way up. The website says the launch of several new books is imminent. I want to be part of this company as it grows.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: This is the last question, Ms. Lenard. What are your salary expectations?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: My  salary expectations are in line with my experience and qualifications.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Boris</span>: I think I have asked you everything. Thank you for coming in.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Thank you for interviewing me.<br />", "id": 3, "time": "61500", "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn9le16ob07re2vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "_data": [], "type": "video", "template_override": 1}]}]}